        {
            "title": "國際｜美前郵政工人認偷禮品卡 佳節寄件須防失竊",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜美前郵政工人認偷禮品卡 佳節寄件須防失竊\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜美前郵政工人認偷禮品卡 佳節寄件須防失竊</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國長島一名36歲前郵政工人承認20項控罪，其中18項為與非法管有贓物及重大盜竊相關的重罪。她被指在2025年於奧克代爾郵局從待寄郵件箱偷取密封信件，掠走禮品卡及彩票，再把空賀卡放回。檢方確認7名受害人。調查人員在其手袋、住所及車輛再發現多封失竊郵件，涉及禮品卡總值800美元。她已於2025年12月辭職。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E7%BE%8E%E5%89%8D%E9%83%B5%E6%94%BF%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA%E8%AA%8D%E5%81%B7%E7%A6%AE%E5%93%81%E5%8D%A1-%E4%BD%B3%E7%AF%80%E5%AF%84%E4%BB%B6%E9%A0%88%E9%98%B2%E5%A4%B1%E7%AB%8A-123053254.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-21 20:43:49",
